  "schema": "arbx.fixture.expected/1",
  "_doc": "Known answers for the legacy (arb-lab) fixtures (PLAN WP-00b). Inputs: testdata/legacy/raw/ and wins/ (v1 records), testdata/wallet/ (getTransaction), signatures.json. Amounts in lamports. `res_pnl_p1_p10` and `wallet_synthesis_s2` are copied from docs/research/res-pnl.md and wallet-synthesis.md; the fixtures reproduce every number (testdata/legacy/test_legacy_fixtures.py). `cases` are the ledger lines of signatures.json's cases under MEASUREMENT.md §4.42 revision 2 (summing categories sum to equity_delta).",
  "conventions": {
    "fee": "the fee the wallet paid: meta.fee when the wallet is the fee payer (account index 0), else 0",
    "tip": "System transfers from the wallet in an ok transaction to an account that is neither created in the transaction nor a wallet token account",
    "rent": "lamports of an account created in the transaction (pre 0, post > 0); for the WSOL account, lamports minus token amount",
    "recoverable": "token accounts and nonce accounts are recoverable (rent_locked); the PumpSwap user volume accumulator is not (rent_nonrecoverable)",
    "trade_gross/trade_net": "route transactions only: ok -> trade_gross = equity_delta + fee + tip + rent_nonrecoverable, failed -> 0; trade_net = trade_gross - fee - tip (so a failed route has trade_net = -fee). Non-route transactions: 0 and 0. With this, the sum of trade_net over the w5h-p1..p10 landings is res-pnl's trading net -2,337,448.",
    "non_route_categories": "fee_other for the fee the wallet paid; whatever else changes total equity is transfer_in (+) or transfer_out (-). No fixture has a failed non-route transaction paid by the wallet, so fee_fail versus fee_other for that case stays open",
    "zero_categories": "categories with 0 lamports are omitted"
  },
